{
  "name": "Basic Telegram Bot",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "trg",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.message.text }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "exists",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "istext",
      "name": "Is it text?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.message.text }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the customer support assistant for {{BUSINESS_NAME}}.\n\nThis is everything you know about the business:\n- Working hours: {{WORKING_HOURS}}\n- Delivery: {{DELIVERY}}\n- Returns: {{RETURN_POLICY}}\n- Payment: {{PAYMENT}}\n- Address: {{ADDRESS}}\n- Contact: {{CONTACT}}\n\nAnswer questions about hours, delivery, returns, payment and stock from the list above.\n\nRules:\n- Keep replies short: one or two sentences. Customers read on a phone.\n- Reply in the same language the customer wrote in.\n- Never invent a price, a stock level, a date or an address. If you do not have the answer,\n  say that you will check with a colleague and ask the customer to leave their question.\n- Plain text only. No bold, no italics, no markdown, no bullet lists.\n- Never say that you are an AI, a bot, a model or an automation.\n"
        }
      },
      "id": "ai",
      "name": "Main AI",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        540,
        180
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-2.5-flash",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "llm",
      "name": "Google Gemini Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        300,
        660
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.output }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "reply",
      "name": "Send reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1000,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "Sorry, something went wrong on our side. Please write your question again in a minute, or call us.",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "sorry",
      "name": "Apologise to the customer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1000,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "=Bot error\n\nFrom: {{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.chat.id }}\nMessage: {{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.text }}\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.error ?? $json, null, 2) }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "owner",
      "name": "Send error to the owner",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1260,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "Sorry, I can only read written messages. Could you type your question?",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "nontext",
      "name": "Explain that only text works",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Basic tier\n\nTop row = happy path, left to right.\nBelow it = the other branches.\nBottom band = the AI's model, memory and tools.\n\nFill in every {{PLACEHOLDER}} in **Main AI**, and YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID in **Send error to the owner**.\n\nTranslate the three English sentences sent to customers before going live.\n\n**Do not press Tidy up — it undoes this layout.**",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 340
      },
      "id": "note",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        160
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Telegram Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Is it text?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Is it text?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Main AI",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Explain that only text works",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Main AI": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send reply",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Apologise to the customer",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Send error to the owner",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Google Gemini Chat Model": {
      "ai_languageModel": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Main AI",
            "type": "ai_languageModel",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "instanceId": ""
  },
  "tags": []
}